WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Jumping medium punch intercepts Ryu’s jump.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.450
Akuma cancels the air-to-air hit into airborne Level 1.

3
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:02.950
The Super projectile strikes Ryu as Akuma descends.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.100
Akuma dashes toward the corner to continue the juggle.

5
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.550
Heavy Tatsu catches Ryu after the dash.

6
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.200
Ryu recovers in the corner after the Tatsu ender.
